OL,5,G1300 The World at One
OL,6,G1345 New Storytellers
OL,7,     F1/5. Thousands visit Penrhyn
OL,8,     FQuarry in Bethesda each year for
OL,9,     Fthe world's fastest zipwire. But
OL,10,     Fwhat do they learn about the slate
OL,11,     Fquarry that shaped and scarred the
OL,12,     Fcommunity?
OL,13,G1400 The Archers
OL,14,     FThe Aldridges are left surprised,
OL,15,     Fand some news hits hard for Tom.
OL,16,G1415 Alone
OL,17,     F1/6. Mitch and Ellie negotiate
OL,18,     Fground rules re overnight stays
OL,19,     Ffor their new relationship while
OL,20,     FMorris is desperate for someone to
OL,21,     Fcook him a roast dinner. Stars
OL,22,     FAngus Deayton.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
