OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke examines Anna
OL,9,     FChristie by Eugene O'Neill.
OL,10,G1500 A Good Read
OL,11,     FWriter Joanne Harris and academic
OL,12,     Fand broadcaster Islam Issa discuss
OL,13,     Fbooks by authors including Shirley
OL,14,     FJackson and Arundhati Roy.
OL,15,G1530 You're Dead to Me
OL,16,     FGreg Jenner is joined in medieval
OL,17,     FEurope by Dr Simon Yarrow and
OL,18,     Fcomedian Rachel Parris to learn
OL,19,     Fall about the cult of saints and
OL,20,     Ftheir relics.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
