OL,5,G2300 Galapagos
OL,6,     F4/5. Bryony is still happy to spin
OL,7,     Fthe narrative about the role of
OL,8,     Fthe Galapagos AI in Karikoga's
OL,9,     Fdeath. But she's about to realise
OL,10,     Fthat Galapagos' influence is now
OL,11,     Fmuch closer to home.
OL,12,G2330 Today in Parliament
OL,13,G0030 Cash Cow by Alev Scott
OL,14,     F1/5. Journalist and author, Alev
OL,15,     FScott, began her compelling
OL,16,     Finvestigation into the global
OL,17,     Ffertility industry when she
OL,18,     Fdiscovered the online market in
OL,19,     Fbreast milk.
OL,20,G0100 World Service
OL,21,     FBBC Radio 4 joins the BBC World
OL,22,     FService.
